meta {
  name: 3. Link Driver by Code
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers/link-by-code
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "driverCode": "{{driverCode}}"
  }
}

docs {
  ALTERNATIVE to step 4 — run this one or that one, not both. Attaches the driver identified by
  {{driverCode}} (captured by driver-onboarding step 5) to the calling torg admin's own torg.

  400 — "Driver already belongs to a fleet" (already linked somewhere), or "Driver's licence is
  not yet verified" (driver-onboarding step 3 hasn't returned VERIFIED yet, and step 4 of that
  flow hasn't been approved by an admin either).
  404 — no driver found with that code.
}
